<p  >Provisional extension of time pending ‘delay analysis’ for completion of total work or part thereof with recorded reasons and release of running/ interim payments to Contractor without deduction of LD/ Penalty subject to submission of Bank Guarantee (BG) by Contractor equivalent to maximum LD / Penalty amount which shall be valid till completion of work and grant of final ‘Time Extension’. However, depending upon the circumstances and merits of each case, the Competent Authority may waive the requirement of Bank Guarantee subject to:</p>
<p  >&nbsp;</p>
<p  >(a) Withholding of amount @ 10 % of subsequent RA/ interim bills till final ‘delay analysis’ and decision on levy of LD/ Penalty or otherwise, and</p>
<p  >&nbsp;</p>
<p  >(b) Ensuring sufficient financial safeguards (e.g. Security Deposit, Retention amount), as appropriate.</p>
</td>
