<p  >(Note: (1) The compensation under SI. No. D.7 A, D.7 B and D.8 put together shall not exceed 15% of the contract value, (2) Power for paying idle wages at D.7 B is in addition to power for ORC i.e both can be done concurrently. (3) PSHQ shall define the admissibility and calculation criteria for ORC and issue necessary guidelines.)</p>
